VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'look at how you can get started with it. Now the models that we\'re going to be using are coming from Sketchfab as we\'ve actually gone ahead to take a look at some of these models and download them just to do a bit of comparison of how'

[01:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'things work. So, with that said, we\'re simply going to go back here and start exploring this particular tool. Now, first things first, how you get started with this is as simple as clicking on open, locating the model that you want. In this case, we\'ll simply start out'

[02:09] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'with a octopus. That looks a bit more complex, so we can click on open and get that in. And that is basically all you do. You click on open, you bring that in, and automatically, it does the retopology for you. Quick, easy, and simple. And just like'

[02:21] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that, you\'ve got this nice retopologized octopus. Now, the reason why we got to start with octopus is because it\'s pretty complex. It\'s got a lot of points and motions to it. So, you can see that from here. And the settings that you'

[02:34] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
