[09:38] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'this working is pretty easy. Once you download it, which you can download for free, you can drag and drop right inside of your Blender, click on okay to have that installed. Then, you have to go over to edit, go over to preference, go over to your add-on section, click right'

[09:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'here, and make sure that you\'ve got the URL of your Auto Remesher plugged in here. It is very necessary that you do that. If you don\'t do that, this tool is'

