[10:17] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'menu, save your preference, close the window, and then bring in any 3D model of choice, and test it out. So, in this case, we\'re simply going to bring in our octopus. I think that\'s a very interesting model. Let\'s bring that in. We can see what the wireframe looks'

